# PesticideNext — fully offline PWA, no API keys required.
#
# This app is a 100% client-side Progressive Web App. All pesticide data,
# calculators, rotation logic, and the field guidebook are bundled and served
# from the service-worker cache. There is NO server-side AI dependency and
# NO environment variable is needed to run it locally or in production.
#
# To develop locally:
#   bun install
#   bun run dev
#
# To build for production:
#   bun run build
#   bun run start
#
# The optional Express server (server.ts) only provides a lightweight visitor
# counter at /api/visitors/* — it is NOT required for the app to function.
# On static hosts (GitHub Pages, Vercel static, Netlify) the visitor counter
# simply stays at zero and everything else works fully offline.
